'''Urashima Taro''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] increases health, attack power, range and grants [[Immune to Weaken|Immunity to Weaken]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.6 Update|Version 8.6]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]].

