==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Urashima Taro was a part of three other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Tortoise and Hare (Removed Combo)|Tortoise and Hare]], [[Ancient Heroes (Removed Combo)|Ancient Heroes]] and [[Ultra Souls (Removed Combo)|Ultra Souls]].
*King Gamereon currently has the fifth highest health (246,500) in the game (third with a Level 10 Defense UP Talent).
*This character is based on the Japanese legend [[wikipedia:Urashima Tarō|Urashima Tarō]].
*Guardian Gamereon is based on [[wikipedia:Gamera|Gamera]], a turtle kaiju who has an ability to breath fire and fireball, and with a title ''Guardian of the Universe''.
*King Gamereon is similar to [[wikipedia:Bowser|King Bowser]], a major antagonist in the ''Mario'' franchise who also has a fireball attack.
*Guardian Gamereon's description is a reference to the virus from [[wikia:residentevil:T-Virus|Biohazard/Resident Evil]] franchise.

